# expect: reject PLN-03
# Names: uppercase, 17 characters, a hyphen, and a name used twice (on different inputs).
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 1 -> 1*95 = 95 bit/s; groups m1g0@10, m1g1@10
# CAN: sum of group rates 20 Hz -> 20*135 = 2700 bit/s; total 2795 bit/s = 0.559 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 50 Hz -> 0.5 samples per 10 ms frame -> 1 packet(s); 9*0.5 + 1*(22+4+66) = 96.5 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 77200 bit/s (limit 2000000)
